    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo Overload</strong> is a short abstract incremental game, about defeating enemies to upgrade yourself to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7ed4e37676c456ae53b8c8dd6480d76c.poster.avif?t=1755288919\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7ed4e37676c456ae53b8c8dd6480d76c.webm?t=1755288919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7ed4e37676c456ae53b8c8dd6480d76c.mp4?t=1755288919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your resources on a huge <strong>skill tree</strong>, with over a <u>100 upgrades</u> to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/2f67719a8d26dc7ffcab744a2a865e01.avif?t=1755288919\" data-has-big width=800 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up the\u00a0<strong>combo</strong>\u00a0by defating enemies, but be careful, you'll lose <strong>combo</strong> when getting damaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7805f7a934bb9fb8e94ae3324e85c30d.poster.avif?t=1755288919\" width=518 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7805f7a934bb9fb8e94ae3324e85c30d.webm?t=1755288919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7805f7a934bb9fb8e94ae3324e85c30d.mp4?t=1755288919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of levels to clear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo Overload</strong> is a short abstract incremental game, about defeating enemies to upgrade yourself to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7ed4e37676c456ae53b8c8dd6480d76c.poster.avif?t=1755288919\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7ed4e37676c456ae53b8c8dd6480d76c.webm?t=1755288919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7ed4e37676c456ae53b8c8dd6480d76c.mp4?t=1755288919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your resources on a huge <strong>skill tree</strong>, with over a <u>100 upgrades</u> to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/2f67719a8d26dc7ffcab744a2a865e01.avif?t=1755288919\" data-has-big width=800 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up the\u00a0<strong>combo</strong>\u00a0by defating enemies, but be careful, you'll lose <strong>combo</strong> when getting damaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7805f7a934bb9fb8e94ae3324e85c30d.poster.avif?t=1755288919\" width=518 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7805f7a934bb9fb8e94ae3324e85c30d.webm?t=1755288919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/7805f7a934bb9fb8e94ae3324e85c30d.mp4?t=1755288919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of levels to clear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types</p></li></ul>",
